</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p5.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p5.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Parameters:<span id="A2.SS1.p5.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
