<span id="A2.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">code</span><span id="A2.I8.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Python code to execute in the Jupyter kernel (required)</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
