<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Analysis of open-source model results.</h3>

<figure id="A2.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T5.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A2.T5.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Results of representative open-source models on <span id="A2.T5.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentVista</span> by category. Domain abbreviations:
<span id="A2.T5.14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Comm.</span> (Commerce), <span id="A2.T5.14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Geog.</span> (Geography), <span id="A2.T5.14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Ent.</span> (Entertainment),
<span id="A2.T5.14.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Tech.</span> (Technology), <span id="A2.T5.14.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Soc.</span> (Society), <span id="A2.T5.14.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Acad.</span> (Academics),
and <span id="A2.T5.14.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Cult.</span> (Culture).
The best-performing model in each category is <span id="A2.T5.14.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">in-bold</span>, and the second best is <span id="A2.T5.14.10" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. All values are accuracies in %.</span></figcaption>
