<br class="ltx_break">Query: <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Dior B30 black sneaker authentic vs fake guide</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Evidence.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Retrieved legit-check guides that highlight tongue tag font, stitching, and interior label formats as key checks.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 2.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">image search</span> 
