<br class="ltx_break">Query: <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.8.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Dior B30 authentic inner size code format</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Evidence.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Guides report authentic style identifiers follow a structured style-ID pattern, rather than generic sticker-like codes.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 5.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">image search</span> 
