<br class="ltx_break"></span>Evidence.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Collected examples where generic interior stickers are associated with replicas.</span></span></span><img src="2602.23166v1/picture/traj1/traj1_step6_1.jpg" id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.g9" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:122/122;" width="122" height="122" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"><img src="2602.23166v1/picture/traj1/traj1_step6_2.jpg" id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.g10" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:122/122;" width="122" height="122" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Final decision.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span>Fake.<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.2.10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
