<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The interior sticker code format is inconsistent with authentic labeling patterns shown in retrieved references.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
